  "solution": {
    "text": "Scale reading will be the sum of weight and force due to their impulse<br /><br />Scale reading =&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi>h</mi></msqrt><mi>m</mi><mi>n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>t</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>n</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi>h</mi></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>",
